IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q09-ACCT-ELIGIBILITY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-AGE             PIC S9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VERIFIED        PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-AGE
ACCEPT WS-VERIFIED
IF WS-AGE >= 18 AND FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-VERIFIED)) = "Y"
    DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE"
ELSE
    DISPLAY "NOT ELIGIBLE"
END-IF
STOP RUN.
